    "Copying from a rendered Markdown code block leaves a blank line between every line, trailing whitespace at the ends, and indentation that does not match your project. This fixes all of it at once." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copying from a rendered Markdown code block leaves a blank line between every line, trailing whitespace at the ends, and indentation that does not match your project. This fixes all of it at once."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markdown으로 렌더링된 코드 블록에서 복사하면 줄마다 빈 줄이 끼어들고, 줄 끝에 공백이 남고, 들여쓰기 폭이 프로젝트와 어긋납니다. 한 번에 정리합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
